B.TC=new A.H(B.Xb,["Fel Principal","clasic",6,"https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/retete-culinare/retete-traditionale/papricas-de-pui-cu-smantana.html","Laura Lauren\u021biu","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/papricas.png",B.R8,"\u2022 1\u20131,5 kg pui cu os, por\u021bionat\n\u2022 200 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103\n\u2022 300 g ceap\u0103\n\u2022 1 c\u0103\u021bel usturoi\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei\n\u2022 30 g boia dulce\n\u2022 40 g f\u0103in\u0103\n\u2022 1\u20132 foi dafin\n\u2022 Ap\u0103 fierbinte c\xe2t s\u0103 acopere carnea\n\u2022 Sare, piper, p\u0103trunjel","1. Rumene\u0219te puiul \xeen ulei 8\u201310 minute, \xeentorc\xe2nd. Scoate \xeentr-un vas; \xeenc\u0103 nu este g\u0103tit \xeen centru.\n2. \xcen aceea\u0219i crati\u021b\u0103 \xeenmoaie ceapa tocat\u0103 7\u20138 minute. Adaug\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i dafinul; amestec\u0103 2 minute.\n3. Adaug\u0103 boiaua, apoi imediat puiul \u0219i apa fierbinte. Fierbe acoperit domol p\xe2n\u0103 se fr\u0103geze\u0219te, men\u021bin\xe2nd lichid suficient. Verific\u0103 minimum 74\xb0C \xeen centru; durata depinde de carne.\n4. Omogenizeaz\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2na cu f\u0103ina \u0219i 3\u20134 linguri ap\u0103 rece. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 \xeen sos, fierbe u\u0219or \xeenc\u0103 5 minute \u0219i potrive\u0219te gustul. Presar\u0103 p\u0103trunjel.",30,60,"Lapte, gr\xe2u (gluten).",4.9,96,"Sursa declar\u0103 90 min total. Puiul de \u021bar\u0103 poate necesita peste o or\u0103 numai la fierbere.",u.E],t.R)
B.X1={categorie:0,colectie:1,portii:2,sursa:3,autor:4,consultat:5,tara_sursa:6,limba_sursa:7,ghid_vizual:8,ingrediente:9,cantitati:10,pasi:11,pregatire:12,alergeni:13,scor_sursa:14,voturi_sursa:15,nota_timp:16}
B.PE=s(["cartofi","branza","bacon"],t.s)
B.TW=new A.H(B.X1,["Fel Principal","clasic",null,"https://savoriurbane.com/cartofi-umpluti-cu-branza/","Savori Urbane","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/cartofi_umpluti.png",B.PE,"\u2022 16\u201320 cartofi noi medii\n\u2022 100 g br\xe2nz\u0103 vaci\n\u2022 1 ou\n\u2022 50 g cheddar\n\u2022 50 g ca\u0219caval tip Trappist\n\u2022 20 felii mici bacon\n\u2022 Sare, piper, chimen","1. Spal\u0103 cartofii noi. Scobe\u0219te cu un dispozitiv potrivit sau \xeenjum\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te \u0219i scoate pu\u021bin miez, p\u0103str\xe2nd pere\u021bii \xeentregi.\n2. Amestec\u0103 br\xe2nzeturile cu oul \u0219i condimentele.\n3. Pune o feliu\u021b\u0103 de bacon \xeen fiecare cavitate, apoi umple cu br\xe2nz\u0103. A\u0219az\u0103 \xeentr-o tav\u0103 ad\xe2nc\u0103.\n4. Coace 20 minute la 180\xb0C, apoi 5\u201310 minute la 160\xb0C. Furculi\u021ba trebuie s\u0103 intre u\u0219or \xeen cartof \u0219i umplutura s\u0103 fie \xeenchegat\u0103; prelunge\u0219te dac\u0103 este necesar.",15,"Lapte, ou; verific\u0103 baconul.",5,2,"Sursa indic\u0103 5\u20136 por\u021bii. Coacere 25\u201330 min, plus preg\u0103tire; pentru ajustare alege mai \xeent\xe2i baza de por\u021bii."],t.R)
