B.TV=new A.H(B.Xg,["echilibrat","Garnituri",5,10,35,238,B.O8,"\u2022 4 cartofi mari, aproximativ 907g\n\u2022 1,92 litri ap\u0103 cu ghea\u021b\u0103\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 usturoi pudr\u0103\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 ceap\u0103 pudr\u0103\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 piper alb\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 ienibahar\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 fulgi de ardei iute\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ulei vegetal","1. Taie cartofii \xeen bastona\u0219e de aproximativ 1,3cm. \u021aine-i acoperi\u021bi \xeen ap\u0103 cu ghea\u021b\u0103, la rece, minimum 1 or\u0103.\n2. Scurge \u0219i usuc\u0103 bine. Pre\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te cuptorul la aproximativ 245\xb0C. Amestec\u0103 bastona\u0219ele cu toate condimentele \u0219i unge-le cu ulei \xeen tav\u0103.\n3. Acoper\u0103 tava cu folie de aluminiu \u0219i coace 15 minute.\n4. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 folia \u0219i coace \xeenc\u0103 15\u201320 minute p\xe2n\u0103 devin aurii, \xeentorc\xe2nd ocazional.","Timpul de r\u0103cire este separat de preg\u0103tire \u0219i coacere.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/baked-french-fries","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Verific\u0103 etichetele condimentelor.","Minimum 1 or\u0103 la rece",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
