B.TP=new A.H(B.Xp,["echilibrat","Aperitive / Gust\u0103ri","Laura Lauren\u021biu","https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/retete-culinare/aperitive/hummus.html","RO","RO","20.10.2026",B.QA,"\u2022 1 conserv\u0103 de n\u0103ut de 300 g, gata fiert; se scurge, lichidul se p\u0103streaz\u0103\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 tahini\n\u2022 1 c\u0103\u021bel de usturoi\n\u2022 Suc de la maximum 1 l\u0103m\xe2ie, dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 3 linguri ulei de m\u0103sline, plus 2\u20133 linguri la servire\n\u2022 1 v\xe2rf de chimion m\u0103cinat\n\u2022 Sare \u0219i piper, dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 La servire: 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 paprika, 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 sumac op\u021bional, verdea\u021b\u0103","1. Scurge n\u0103utul gata fiert \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 lichidul. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 usturoiul; stoarce l\u0103m\xe2ia f\u0103r\u0103 s\xe2mburi.\n2. Paseaz\u0103 n\u0103utul cu tahini, usturoi, ulei \u0219i suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie ad\u0103ugat dup\u0103 gust.\n3. Toarn\u0103 treptat pu\u021bin lichid din conserv\u0103, p\xe2n\u0103 ob\u021bii o crem\u0103 legat\u0103. Potrive\u0219te chimionul, sarea \u0219i piperul.\n4. Serve\u0219te cu uleiul \u0219i condimentele indicate sau p\u0103streaz\u0103 acoperit la frigider p\xe2n\u0103 la servire.","Cele 5 minute presupun n\u0103ut deja fiert, din conserv\u0103. Nu folosi boabe uscate \xeen aceast\u0103 variant\u0103.","Susan \xeen tahini. Verific\u0103 \u0219i etichetele produselor.",!0,4,5,0,5,!0,"N\u0103ut gata fiert, din conserv\u0103.",B.O5,4.9,154],t.R)
