B.Ty=new A.H(B.X0,["echilibrat","Salate","Diva \xeen Buc\u0103t\u0103rie","https://divainbucatarie.ro/2010/11/13/salata-de-fasole-boabe/","RO","RO","20.10.2026",B.Ok,"\u2022 400 g fasole gata fiart\u0103, din conserv\u0103\n\u2022 1 m\xe2n\u0103 de m\u0103sline negre \u0219i verzi\n\u2022 1 leg\u0103tur\u0103 mic\u0103 p\u0103trunjel\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 generoas\u0103 o\u021bet de mere sau de vin\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ap\u0103\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei de m\u0103sline\n\u2022 1 ceap\u0103 ro\u0219ie medie\n\u2022 Sare \u0219i piper, dup\u0103 gust","1. Scurge \u0219i cl\u0103te\u0219te fasolea gata fiart\u0103. Pune boabele \xeentr-un bol.\n2. Taie ceapa felii sub\u021biri \u0219i p\u0103trunjelul m\u0103runt; adaug\u0103-le cu m\u0103slinele peste fasole.\n3. Combin\u0103 separat o\u021betul, apa, uleiul, sarea \u0219i piperul. Toarn\u0103 peste salat\u0103 \u0219i amestec\u0103 delicat.\n4. Gust\u0103 \u0219i potrive\u0219te aciditatea. Po\u021bi servi imediat sau l\u0103sa op\u021bional 1 or\u0103 la frigider pentru arom\u0103.","Este varianta cu fasole gata fiart\u0103. Sursa nu declar\u0103 un timp total m\u0103surat \u0219i nici un num\u0103r de por\u021bii.","Verific\u0103 etichetele m\u0103slinelor, o\u021betului \u0219i conservei, inclusiv pentru sulfi\u021bi.",!0,0,!0,"Op\u021bional: 1 or\u0103 la frigider","Fasole gata fiart\u0103, din conserv\u0103.",B.Qq],t.R)
